    "sections": {
        "description": "The Hq Pages theme is a modern and fast WordPress template, perfect for creating a unique and functional website. It offers an intuitive interface and many customizable options, allowing you to easily adapt it to your needs. Fully widgetized, the theme allows users to manage content using convenient widgets. The responsive design ensures correct display on all devices - from mobile phones to desktop computers. The template also supports integration with popular plugins, expanding its functionality. Hq Pages is aesthetically pleasing and offers many ready-made layouts and stylish elements. With its help, you can create both a personal blog and a powerful corporate site or online store. Excellent documentation and support make the customization process even easier! Live preview is available at: https://demo-hq-pages.hq-web.net."
    },
